      "background_image_url": "https://assets.quickhub.ai/qh-social/user-image/1790676975_a5da81e4-21aa-4612-8ac9-c25b57fa8652.png",
      "background": {
        "kind": "background_photo",
        "generate": true,
        "transparent": false,
        "prompt": "Create a minimalist background with a light gray base color. Add two large, textured white semicircles: one in the upper-left corner (0–40% across, 0–40% down) and another in the upper-right corner (60–100% across, 0–40% down). Include a grid of small black dots (3x3) in the lower-right quadrant (70–90% across, 70–90% down). Ensure the overall style is clean and modern with a subtle grainy texture on the semicircles for depth. Keep the area in the lower-left quadrant (0–60% across, 30–100% down) clear for a photo layer. A separate round photo layer covers the lower-left of the frame (about 0–59% across, 33–100% down): draw no circle, ring, frame, shadow or photo there — keep plain background surface, as if the canvas physically ended at that boundary; do not let the scene, gradient or lighting reach into it even faded. No text, lettering, logos or watermarks anywhere in the image.",
        "reference_url": "https://assets.quickhub.ai/qh-social/user-image/1790676975_a5da81e4-21aa-4612-8ac9-c25b57fa8652.png",
        "notes": "Ensure the background maintains high contrast for dark text in the upper-right and middle-right areas. Text fixed in black sits in the upper-right of the frame (about 76–93% across, 7–16% down); the middle-right of the frame (about 54–93% across, 47–62% down); the lower-right of the frame (about 63–93% across, 86–91% down), so there the background must stay a light, calm tone that it reads clearly on — never dark or busy, even when a brief asks for a moody palette. Text fixed in dark (rgb(81, 63, 44)) sits in the upper-right of the frame (about 56–94% across, 16–46% down); the lower-right of the frame (about 78–93% across, 80–86% down), so there the background must stay a light, calm tone that it reads clearly on — never dark or busy, even when a brief asks for a moody palette. The photo frames are separate layers; a regenerated background must not contain its own circles, rings or photos under them."
      },
